  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>Points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are coplanar,</p><p>Now we know that condition of coplanarity is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>51</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>57</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So product of roots will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>95</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
